# Parametric Analysis

## Objective
To evaluate system performance across varying operating conditions.

---

## Parameters Tested
- Voltage Range: 9V – 13V
- Temperature Range: 25°C – 60°C
- GSM Signal Strength: Low to High

---

## Results
- System stable within defined operating limits
- Protection triggered correctly beyond thresholds
- Communication delay increases under low signal

---

## Conclusion
System meets expected performance across tested parameter ranges.
